{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_ffff823318fe4d0f81967d8266cdf80c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_580a470fef8f579e4cd916b542bcc50f02d688e7cb6c2e8f9dcb2e419042402f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"twing-dev/twing-cli@49b1d2c19911 snapshot 77b105848016c816","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d8f318282e665600393b233d2275a57e63b41dc112d9c86ba2e759921f97f25d"],"source_ids":["src_5d6d6f2ab9135edf952c47856431bec5"],"text":"Twing is a CLI plus a hook for coding agents (Claude Code today, others planned) and a small server that every agent's client talks to, letting multiple agents on a team coordinate.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ffff823318fe4d0f81967d8266cdf80c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_ffff823318fe4d0f81967d8266cdf80c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_752afc4d5f3c5b3e7ce6d7a9215271068d38f5259fcba201859d1ca0f6c40b4e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"twing-dev/twing-cli@49b1d2c19911 snapshot 77b105848016c816","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_49e7b22b66087aaf9321c59610228d322d953e690386bf1f830a3f2512792c76","slc_de7324a7aa43406cef21f7f54bf769c6b5616d202154553dcb521d2a2943494e"],"source_ids":["src_5d6d6f2ab9135edf952c47856431bec5"],"text":"Conflicts collapse into four buckets; bucket 1 (constraint violations) is admin-gated and blocking, bucket 2 never blocks, and peer-vs-peer buckets 3/4 can be self-resolved with a justification.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ffff823318fe4d0f81967d8266cdf80c"}
